<Project>

  <!-- Inherit the repository-wide policy. -->
  <Import Project="$([MSBuild]::GetPathOfFileAbove('Directory.Build.props', '$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../'))" />

  <!--
    Raven adds nothing to the repository policy and suppresses nothing.

    Everything this file previously carried has been fixed at the source rather
    than silenced:

      CA1051 (27)  public fields in the SyntaxGenerator XML model → properties
      CA1822 (5)   members that never read instance state → static
      CA1051 (4)   ANTLR lexer-base fields → private protected
      CA1512 (2)   → ArgumentOutOfRangeException.ThrowIfNegative/ThrowIfLessThan
      CA1036 (2)   IComparable types → comparison operators
      CA1716 (1)   `module` parameter → `irModule`, propagated to implementations
      CA1725 (1)   parameter name aligned with the overridden member
      CA1816 (1)   Dispose → GC.SuppressFinalize
      CA2000 (1)   StringBuilderReader → using
      CA1847/1820  string.Contains(char), string.Length
      CA1050 (1)   generator entry point → namespace SyntaxGenerator
      RS2008 (3)   → AnalyzerReleases.{Shipped,Unshipped}.md
      CS8602 (2)   → Assert.IsType/IsAssignableFrom instead of `as` + dereference
      CS9113 (1)   unused ITestOutputHelper parameter removed
      NU1903, CS3021, CA1852, CA1859 — no longer reported at all

    Three rules are excluded by name in the repository .editorconfig, each with a
    written reason: CA1707 (test naming), CA1720 (shader type names), and the
    CA1002/CA2227/CA1819 trio imposed by XmlSerializer on the generator's DTOs.

    The build is warning-free.
  -->

</Project>
